WEBVTT

1
00:00:31.458 --> 00:00:34.416
In the previous verses of Chapter 15,

2
00:00:34.416 --> 00:00:35.750
Lord Krishna explained

3
00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:38.000
that the bondages of this world

4
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:41.416
must be cut with the axe of detachment.

5
00:00:41.416 --> 00:00:44.333
Now He shows the path ahead –

6
00:00:44.333 --> 00:00:47.500
leaving the world behind is not the goal in itself.

7
00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:50.083
Detachment is only the first step.

8
00:00:50.083 --> 00:00:53.791
It prepares us to seek the eternal abode –

9
00:00:53.791 --> 00:00:56.375
the shelter

10
00:00:56.375 --> 00:00:59.083
of the Adi Purusha.

11
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:06.083
In this verse, Lord Krishna describes

12
00:01:06.083 --> 00:01:08.291
a two-stage journey.

13
00:01:08.291 --> 00:01:10.083
The first stage is –

14
00:01:10.083 --> 00:01:12.958
when we have cut through our bondages,

15
00:01:12.958 --> 00:01:15.958
we must seek that abode

16
00:01:15.958 --> 00:01:19.833
from which no one returns.

17
00:01:19.833 --> 00:01:22.833
That is the eternal spiritual realm.

18
00:01:22.833 --> 00:01:26.458
The second stage is – upon reaching there,

19
00:01:26.458 --> 00:01:30.083
we must take shelter of the Adi Purusha –

20
00:01:30.083 --> 00:01:34.791
the original source of all
creation and movement.

21
00:01:34.791 --> 00:01:38.416
This verse clears a deep misconception –

22
00:01:38.416 --> 00:01:40.458
that spiritual life means

23
00:01:40.458 --> 00:01:42.625
only renunciation of the world.

24
00:01:42.625 --> 00:01:46.541
No – renunciation is only half the journey.

25
00:01:46.541 --> 00:01:48.458
After that, the real goal is –

26
00:01:48.458 --> 00:01:53.416
to seek that eternal abode and
take shelter of the Adi Purusha,

27
00:01:53.416 --> 00:01:55.833
Lord Krishna Himself.

28
00:01:55.833 --> 00:01:58.750
This abode is called tatah padam –

29
00:01:58.750 --> 00:02:02.333
the state from which no one returns.

30
00:02:02.333 --> 00:02:04.875
It is not an empty void,

31
00:02:04.875 --> 00:02:07.458
but a realm of complete consciousness,

32
00:02:07.458 --> 00:02:08.291
where the soul

33
00:02:08.291 --> 00:02:10.500
exists in its true nature –

34
00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:14.625
in a loving relationship with the Supreme.

35
00:02:14.625 --> 00:02:17.666
And who is that Adi Purusha?

36
00:02:17.666 --> 00:02:19.791
Lord Krishna Himself –

37
00:02:19.791 --> 00:02:22.708
who says that all of creation

38
00:02:22.708 --> 00:02:25.750
has flowed from Him since time immemorial.

39
00:02:25.750 --> 00:02:28.833
As He declared in Chapter 10 –

40
00:02:28.833 --> 00:02:31.416
‘Aham sarvasya prabhavah –

41
00:02:31.416 --> 00:02:33.583
I am the source of all.’

42
00:02:33.583 --> 00:02:36.750
Thus Lord Krishna makes it clear –

43
00:02:36.750 --> 00:02:41.083
‘Detachment is necessary, but do not stop there.

44
00:02:41.083 --> 00:02:43.625
Move forward and come to My shelter.

45
00:02:43.625 --> 00:02:45.583
You may reach this truth slowly,

46
00:02:45.583 --> 00:02:47.458
over many lifetimes,

47
00:02:47.458 --> 00:02:49.666
through the path of detachment.

48
00:02:49.666 --> 00:02:51.375
Or you may surrender

49
00:02:51.375 --> 00:02:54.416
directly to Me through devotion and complete

50
00:02:54.416 --> 00:02:57.541
the entire journey in this very life.’

51
00:02:57.541 --> 00:03:00.500
However vast and complex this world may seem

52
00:03:00.500 --> 00:03:03.833
like the Ashwattha tree,

53
00:03:03.833 --> 00:03:05.666
the path to liberation is simple –

54
00:03:05.666 --> 00:03:07.666
cut the roots of attachment

55
00:03:07.666 --> 00:03:10.041
and walk the path of surrender.

56
00:03:10.041 --> 00:03:14.125
And when you do, you will naturally

57
00:03:14.125 --> 00:03:16.000
arrive at Me.

58
00:03:21.208 --> 00:03:23.208
Reflect on this –

59
00:03:23.208 --> 00:03:26.000
sometimes the mind thinks that freedom

60
00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:28.083
lies only in letting go –

61
00:03:28.083 --> 00:03:33.583
of pain, of people, of past failures.

62
00:03:33.583 --> 00:03:38.000
Yes, this is where it begins.

63
00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:42.875
But remember – letting go is not the destination.

64
00:03:42.875 --> 00:03:45.958
It only opens the path.

65
00:03:45.958 --> 00:03:49.000
If you stop here,

66
00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:54.000
you will find emptiness within –

67
00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:57.250
not true liberation.

68
00:03:57.250 --> 00:03:58.666
After detachment,

69
00:03:58.666 --> 00:04:02.583
the mind asks – ‘What now?

70
00:04:02.583 --> 00:04:05.458
Which direction should I go?’

71
00:04:05.458 --> 00:04:08.333
This is why I said –

72
00:04:08.333 --> 00:04:12.458
‘When you have cut down this illusory tree,

73
00:04:12.458 --> 00:04:15.833
then seek that abode

74
00:04:15.833 --> 00:04:19.958
from which there is no return.’

75
00:04:19.958 --> 00:04:22.041
That is

76
00:04:22.041 --> 00:04:25.083
your eternal home –

77
00:04:25.083 --> 00:04:28.208
where love never breaks,

78
00:04:28.208 --> 00:04:31.875
joy never diminishes,

79
00:04:31.875 --> 00:04:35.625
and your identity does not change

80
00:04:35.625 --> 00:04:38.708
with moods or roles.

81
00:04:38.708 --> 00:04:41.333
That is

82
00:04:41.333 --> 00:04:43.458
Me.

83
00:04:43.458 --> 00:04:47.958
I do not ask for blind surrender.

84
00:04:47.958 --> 00:04:51.166
I only show the direction

85
00:04:51.166 --> 00:04:54.958
from which you can rise higher.

86
00:04:54.958 --> 00:04:57.708
So do not fear the emptiness

87
00:04:57.708 --> 00:05:01.166
after letting go.

88
00:05:01.166 --> 00:05:03.500
Fill it with purpose.

89
00:05:03.500 --> 00:05:05.250
Walk toward

90
00:05:05.250 --> 00:05:09.083
where going nourishes the soul –

91
00:05:09.083 --> 00:05:12.208
not merely quiets the mind.

92
00:05:12.208 --> 00:05:13.625
Letting go

93
00:05:13.625 --> 00:05:16.708
is your first victory.

94
00:05:16.708 --> 00:05:19.166
Walking toward Me –

95
00:05:19.166 --> 00:05:22.250
your eternal freedom.

96
00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:24.583
Renouncing attachments is necessary,

97
00:05:24.583 --> 00:05:28.041
but reaching My

98
00:05:28.041 --> 00:05:32.000
eternal abode after that renunciation

99
00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:34.041
is the true completion.

100
00:05:38.791 --> 00:05:41.375
Many times, family life

101
00:05:41.375 --> 00:05:42.958
remains limited

102
00:05:42.958 --> 00:05:46.833
to only being together on the surface –

103
00:05:46.833 --> 00:05:51.416
sharing meals, solving problems, and

104
00:05:51.416 --> 00:05:52.791
celebrating occasions.

105
00:05:52.791 --> 00:05:54.708
But think –

106
00:05:54.708 --> 00:05:57.791
is this enough?

107
00:05:57.791 --> 00:06:01.250
True love does not only give support –

108
00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:03.833
it also lifts upward.

109
00:06:03.833 --> 00:06:07.083
It does not only protect –

110
00:06:07.083 --> 00:06:09.375
it also shows the right direction.

111
00:06:09.375 --> 00:06:13.083
This is why I said –

112
00:06:13.083 --> 00:06:16.166
when you cut the roots of illusion,

113
00:06:16.166 --> 00:06:20.291
also seek the path

114
00:06:20.291 --> 00:06:23.250
that is eternal.

115
00:06:23.250 --> 00:06:25.041
In family life too,

116
00:06:25.041 --> 00:06:29.500
detachment does not only mean
giving up habits, bitterness,

117
00:06:29.500 --> 00:06:33.375
or limited roles –

118
00:06:33.375 --> 00:06:38.166
it means recognising a larger purpose.

119
00:06:38.166 --> 00:06:40.791
Inspire each other to ask –

120
00:06:40.791 --> 00:06:47.083
‘What are we living for?

121
00:06:47.083 --> 00:06:52.250
What truly matters in our lives?’

122
00:06:52.250 --> 00:06:55.291
True freedom in the family does not come

123
00:06:55.291 --> 00:07:00.958
from avoiding conflict or keeping
everyone happy.

124
00:07:00.958 --> 00:07:05.083
It comes when you all move forward together

125
00:07:05.083 --> 00:07:08.625
with honesty and spirituality.

126
00:07:08.625 --> 00:07:10.500
Only then

127
00:07:10.500 --> 00:07:15.875
does the family not remain merely a home –

128
00:07:15.875 --> 00:07:19.000
it becomes a shelter

129
00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:20.833
that leads toward liberation.

130
00:07:25.583 --> 00:07:28.916
At the workplace it is often said –

131
00:07:28.916 --> 00:07:30.541
‘Work harder,

132
00:07:30.541 --> 00:07:33.750
meet your targets, reach for the heights.’

133
00:07:33.750 --> 00:07:35.958
Slowly, knowingly or not,

134
00:07:35.958 --> 00:07:40.583
you begin to surrender to the pressure –

135
00:07:40.583 --> 00:07:42.666
under the weight of targets,

136
00:07:42.666 --> 00:07:46.833
in the hunger for recognition, or in a routine

137
00:07:46.833 --> 00:07:51.583
that dims your spark.

138
00:07:51.583 --> 00:07:56.166
But this is not true surrender.

139
00:07:56.166 --> 00:07:58.375
This is fatigue –

140
00:07:58.375 --> 00:08:02.083
merely given the name of surrender.

141
00:08:02.083 --> 00:08:07.458
I too want your surrender –
but not through pressure.

142
00:08:07.458 --> 00:08:11.291
Through purpose.

143
00:08:11.291 --> 00:08:15.541
Adopt a perspective that not only rewards you,

144
00:08:15.541 --> 00:08:20.083
but also lifts you higher from within.

145
00:08:20.083 --> 00:08:26.541
Connect your effort to impact, truth,
service, and growth –

146
00:08:26.541 --> 00:08:31.000
things that are far greater than
your individual self.

147
00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:34.291
When work is connected to purpose,

148
00:08:34.291 --> 00:08:39.333
even hours of effort feel light,

149
00:08:39.333 --> 00:08:43.541
and failures become stepping stones.

150
00:08:43.541 --> 00:08:46.375
As I have said –

151
00:08:46.375 --> 00:08:48.791
after cutting through illusion,

152
00:08:48.791 --> 00:08:53.625
walking the path of surrender is the real journey.

153
00:08:53.625 --> 00:08:57.000
This applies at the workplace too.

154
00:08:57.000 --> 00:09:01.291
Do not only create distance from
the outer noise –

155
00:09:01.291 --> 00:09:06.500
also find within you a deep purpose

156
00:09:06.500 --> 00:09:07.500
to which

157
00:09:07.500 --> 00:09:11.875
you can offer yourself completely.

158
00:09:11.875 --> 00:09:16.041
Then work will no longer be a burden –

159
00:09:16.041 --> 00:09:20.291
it will become your true offering.

160
00:09:20.291 --> 00:09:21.458
Reflect on this.
